The search check in step 2 hardcodes the encoded email (`query=e2e\.customer%40example\.com`), which goes against your rule never to hardcode the email; it's the value the plan specifies. To build it from `CUSTOMER.email` instead, use `new RegExp(\`query=${encodeURIComponent(CUSTOMER.email)}\`)`.

